 "remarks": "Welcome to 71 Aiken Street #D9, a charming and spacious family flat offering 1,152 square feet of comfortable living space in Norwalk--one-level living at its finest. Built in 1979 and featuring 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom, this inviting home showcases a thoughtful layout designed for easy everyday living. The entry leads into an open-concept living and dining area complete with a cozy fireplace and sliders to a private patio space. The spacious kitchen connects smoothly to the living space, while the two well-sized bedrooms offer great privacy on opposite sides of the hall, accompanied by a central full bathroom and convenient in-unit laundry with newer machines. Located within the desirable Winnipauk Village complex, residents enjoy fantastic resort-style amenities including two pools, a kiddie pool, a clubhouse, a gym, and pickleball courts. Recent complex updates include newly paved grounds, new fiberoptic installation, siding, a roof, and decks. Complete with a pet-friendly atmosphere, one reserved parking space, ample unreserved parking, central air. The complex is minutes from shopping, restaurants, and schools--with free access to Calf Pasture and Shady beaches! This wonderful Norwalk property is ready for you to move right in!",
